  "notes": [
    "Locked f4exb/sdrangel v7.27.2 = 97e9e21 (sources.lock.json); v8.0.0 (2026-10-24) adds an MCP server feature and new demodulators and stays the next re-pin candidate (build/15, W2 SW-SDRANGEL rows).",
    "deployment/patches/sdrangel-rx-only.patch (vendor_patch target hashes) keeps out of the build: plugins/samplesink and plugins/samplemimo (testsink, fileoutput, localoutput and audiooutput are unconditional at 97e9e21, testmi and testmosync too, audiocatsiso whenever Hamlib is found); the unconditional inputs localinput, audioinput, kiwisdr and remotetcpinput; the M17, Meshtastic and MeshCore modem libraries and WDSP, which only disabled plugins use. The text decoders demodnavtex, demodrtty and demodpacket build only in server mode (build/07-pz-vstanovlennia.md:422). Core libraries install into /opt/sdrangel/lib, so lib/sdrangel holds only plugins/ and pluginssrv/, the tree selftest RX-02 walks.",
    "Every option() the configure evaluates is set (check_options): ON only the build/07 allowlist that noble can build; ENABLE_CHANNELTX, ENABLE_CHANNELMIMO, every Tx and MIMO channel, every device family except RTL-SDR, AirspyHF and SoapySDR, ENABLE_LIBUNWIND, BUILD_BENCH and the profiler are OFF. ENABLE_CHANNELTX_MOD802.15.4 has dots in its name (no cache entry the check reads) and is never added because ENABLE_CHANNELTX is OFF.",
    "Not built although build/07 allows them: sigmffileinput (noble libsigmf 1.0.2-2 is header-only without libsigmf/sigmf_sdrangel_generated.h, cmake/Modules/FindLibSigMF.cmake), satellitetracker (no libsgp4), startracker (no cspice), morsedecoder (no ggmorse) and denoiser (no rnnoise) in the 20261020T000000Z snapshot, and skymap (needs QtWebEngine and remote sky surveys). ENABLE_EXTERNAL_LIBRARIES=OFF keeps the build to prebuilt noble libraries; no libhamlib-dev, libcodec2-dev, libcm256cc-dev or libsigmf is installed.",
    "ARCH_OPT=armv8-a (the noble arm64 baseline) instead of the upstream default native: -march=native would tie the binaries to the CI runner's CPU. VKFFT_BACKEND=1 (upstream default) without a CUDA toolkit: FFTW and KissFFT only, and no Vulkan path although qtbase5-dev pulls libvulkan-dev.",
    "The package hook (check_recipe.py package) checks the exact plugin and library sets, links /usr/bin/sdrangel and /usr/bin/sdrangelsrv to /opt/sdrangel/bin (the engine lease runs /usr/bin/env sdrangelsrv) and writes the unsigned per-file RX-02 manifest of /opt/sdrangel (status OPEN, never REVIEWED here); runtime_check.py starts sdrangelsrv -a 127.0.0.1 offline and compares the REST plugin lists with the allowlist. CI model only; RX-02 stays BLOCKED until the owner signs a reviewed manifest."
  ],
